WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.470
You know you have it.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.280
You kept it once.

3
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.430
Somewhere.

4
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.623
Once should be enough.

5
00:00:07.643 --> 00:00:11.513
So ask Found. Right where the question is.

6
00:00:13.043 --> 00:00:16.513
It finds the page, not just the file.

7
00:00:18.043 --> 00:00:20.713
Then answer with what you kept.

8
00:00:26.376 --> 00:00:30.813
Found is one private place for everything worth finding again.

9
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:34.783
Keep anything, from any app, in one move.

10
00:00:37.599 --> 00:00:42.269
Gather what belongs together. Keep what matters close.

11
00:00:42.549 --> 00:00:46.179
Quick. Earlier, you saw a pasta place.

12
00:00:47.786 --> 00:00:50.536
You only had to remember "pasta".

13
00:00:51.686 --> 00:00:56.836
Found reads the words in your photos, and the pages of your PDFs.

14
00:00:57.019 --> 00:01:03.116
With Apple Intelligence, What's Inside pulls out the details, and even suggests a name.

15
00:01:03.136 --> 00:01:07.966
It notices the dates inside, and brings them back in time.

16
00:01:09.686 --> 00:01:11.666
Or just ask Siri.

17
00:01:11.686 --> 00:01:14.336
“Hey Siri, ask Found a question.”

18
00:01:14.386 --> 00:01:15.386
“What would you like to know?”

19
00:01:15.486 --> 00:01:16.686
“When is the soft open?”

20
00:01:20.503 --> 00:01:23.533
No account. No Found server.

21
00:01:23.553 --> 00:01:26.183
Your library stays on your iPhone.

22
00:01:26.203 --> 00:01:28.854
And everything you've seen is free.

23
00:01:28.874 --> 00:01:33.404
If Found earns a place in your day, there's First Edition.

24
00:01:33.424 --> 00:01:37.694
Your name on a bookplate, and two icons of your own.

25
00:01:38.224 --> 00:01:44.094
One person builds Found. First Edition helps write what comes next.

26
00:01:44.457 --> 00:01:47.587
Coming next: Found on your Mac.

27
00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:51.937
Your library on every device, through your own iCloud.

28
00:01:51.957 --> 00:01:55.887
And the AI apps you choose, only if you let them.

29
00:01:55.907 --> 00:01:57.187
Found.

30
00:01:57.207 --> 00:01:59.877
Keep something worth finding again.
